s=\"strong\">Janet</span> : Mr. Farmani. I was expecting your call. Is there anything I can help you with?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span> : Yes, indeed. You might want to take a seat and listen to what I have to say.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span> : Okay. I have a stand-up meeting with my team shortly. We ought to keep it brief.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span> : I'm not satisfied with the immediate media repercussions. I've been receiving threats from human rights groups. Polygon'd better get their act together and do something about this.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span> : I understand you are having a few problems, Mr. Farmani. Could you give me some more details please?", "id": 1, "time": "20", "image": "engenn8le14ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span> : I'm very dissatisfied with the service I received. The press release was supposed to alleviate the crisis. Instead, I'm getting bombarded by the press.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>  : I truly understand your concerns. However, together we ought to come up with another plan. I'd better call a meeting to discuss what our next move ought to be.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>  : It's not enough. I'd like to know why nothing has been done so far. This issue had better be addressed before it's too late.", "id": 2, "time": "33400", "image": "engenn8le14ob01re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span> : I completely understand how you feel, Mr. Farmani. We ought to come up with a swift and appropriate crisis communication response. We might want to hire another spokesperson.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>  : I'm not sure this is going to address the issue here. My organization's good name ought to be preserved.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>  : We really appreciate the feedback. But we might want to approach this differently.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>  : What do you have in mind? It'd better be good.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>  : I can assure you we'll do our best.", "id": 3, "time": "61400", "image": "engenn8le14ob01re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le14ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le14ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}